<title>UK: NWE gasoline steady after recent gains.</title>
<headline>NWE gasoline steady after recent gains.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>NWE gasoline consolidated the gains made over the last couple of days, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Eurograde barges sold at $188 fob AR with barrels subsequently offered around $189 fob.</p>
<p>Traders said the strong U.S. market could draw materal trans-atlantic, further supporting the bullish tone in NWE.</p>
<p>August swaps were pegged around $189.50 with September backwardated by $2 or so.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8980</p>
